case the issue wouldn't end up in any sort of memory\ncorruption if we didn't safely crash, but these are quite tricky to\nreason about, so it's better to avoid the reentrancy altogether if\npossible.\n\nI tried to convert the fuzzer test-case in a crashtest but failed (as\nin, it didn't crash without the patch under the test harness).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D115943", "files": ["layout/style/ImageLoader.cpp", "layout/style/nsStyleStruct.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1fa86b393acf244297ac6babaee17c8c7c28c062", "parents": ["36bca8ad92bd909da489c12bed53b162d5000640"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1665836 - Make CacheIOThread::ThreadFunc hold reference to thread. r=kershaw, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D118157", "files": ["netwerk/cache2/CacheIOThread.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f6909aab9899dc87c983d6b1de86eadcb63916dc", "parents": ["1fa86b393acf244297ac6babaee17c8c7c28c062"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Eitan Isaacson \u003ceitan@monotonous.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1706910 - Don't expose MOXAccessible with represented view to AppKit. r=morgan, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D114797", "files": ["accessible/mac/MOXAccessibleBase.mm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3d3d5640bfac60507d42648dc4d9c20e9e0f84a8", "parents": ["f6909aab9899dc87c983d6b1de86eadcb63916dc"], "tags": ["FIREFOX_78_12_0esr_BUILD1", "FIREFOX_78_12_0esr_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1625600481, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}}
